{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sindresorhus/ky/pulls/578","id":1833001066,"node_id":"PR_kwDOCMjFuM5tQWBq","html_url":"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ky/pull/578","diff_url":"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ky/pull/578.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ky/pull/578.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sindresorhus/ky/issues/578","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sindresorhus/ky/pulls/578/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sindresorhus/ky/pulls/578/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sindresorhus/ky/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sindresorhus/ky/issues/578/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sindresorhus/ky/statuses/ebfc6f4dad3764086ab4be39ec48f7b83058b7dd","number":578,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix request types for use with Node","user":{"login":"jliuhtonen","id":1022541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjI1NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1022541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen","html_url":"https://github.com/jliuhtonen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<img width=\"609\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-04-20 at 21 59 11\" src=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ky/assets/1022541/34c7e1ac-1d29-4439-8a33-4f46046487d5\">\r\n\r\nWhen using Ky with Node, TypeScript will run into compilation error regarding types required by `UndiciRequestInit`. This is because `@types/node` does not yet provide these types, and they are not imported from `undici-types` either. The latter would not even be possible to keep Ky usable with browsers.\r\n\r\nThis happened to work in the project, because `@sindresorhus/tsconfig` includes `DOM` in the libs section. In most Node applications, the DOM lib should not be there and clashes with Node types. One way to circumvent this is to add `skipLibCheck: true` to `tsconfig.json`, but this is not a good solution.\r\n\r\nThis commit adds the needed types until `@types/node` imports the missing types and adds them to globals. After that, all \"Undici\" types from the request types should be removed.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-04-20T20:02:15Z","updated_at":"2024-04-22T17:17:48Z","closed_at":"2024-04-22T06:20:27Z","merged_at":"2024-04-22T06:20:27Z","merge_commit_sha":"10a4ec74ab9a4e57951ec2ec29c8a5068f7bb5a1","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jliuhtonen:fix/request-types-in-node-project","ref":"fix/request-types-in-node-project","repo":{"id":789509754,"node_id":"R_kgDOLw72eg","name":"ky","full_name":"jliuhtonen/ky","owner":{"login":"jliuhtonen","id":1022541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjI1NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1022541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen","html_url":"https://github.com/jliuhtonen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliuhtonen/subscript